            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lucky Sheeley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Love this corn recipe! I usually let it cook for about 4 minutes in the boiling water before taking off the heat, but I like my corn a little more cooked than al dente, but this recipe is the bomb!! !\nDefinitely a 5-star to our household!",
            "datePublished": "2020-07-05T02:54:48.623Z"
          },
