              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ChefDad"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made it just as described. I seem to need to leave the corn in way more than 10 minutes , at 10 minutes it is still too hard, love it though it's my go to for corn on the cobb.",
            "datePublished": "2021-12-18T01:27:18.097Z"
