              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Karen Hansen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is my go-to recipe for corn on the cob. The only difference I made is I place the corn in cold water and let it boil that way. Once it reaches boiling point, then I add the sugar and lemon. Give it a stir and put the lid on. Perfect every time!",
